      "id": "6a6c66a7a2ea25419dd02349",
      "text": "陣太鼓ソフト",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1785489069,
      "updated": 1785489069
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c66b500000000005d05b6",
      "text": " 陣太鼓...餡子の中に餅が入ったお菓子",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1785489069,
      "updated": 1785489444
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c682d00000000005d05b8",
      "text": " それをソフトクリームの中に丸ごと入れる→陣太鼓ソフト",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1785489444,
      "updated": 1785489462
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c683f00000000005d05b9",
      "text": "  ソフトクリーム⊃餡子⊃餅？",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1785489462,
      "updated": 1785489489
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c685b00000000005d05ba",
      "text": " 地元の人(n=1)曰く「餅の感触はほとんどない」らしい",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1785489490,
      "updated": 1785489525
    },
